  "body_html": "<h1>VCG Welfare And Payments</h1>\n<p>The VCG interface defines social welfare for reported valuation profiles,\nefficient allocations, welfare without a given agent, Clarke-pivot payments,\nand the induced direct and transfer mechanisms.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:md_vcg_interface] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
